{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/yRA--hz86qAyD4DZt35_RQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:01:16.786092+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/yRA--hz86qAyD4DZt35_RQ","html":"<div><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/XUHLWcesK0C7yjHlAZsicqPEW6AicAd1Pmj4umtmxictQHWuz9q6VGyia1gz1JGQOXKUpLJRJelhtsoiaJRE3QbzhLg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><span>江南大学集成电路学院顺应国家集成电路战略性新兴产业发展和“新工科”建设要求而成立，学院目前拥有“微电子科学与工程”和“电子封装技术”两个本科专业，“电子科学与技术”、“集成电路科学与工程”两个一级学科硕士点和“集成电路工程”专业硕士学位点，并在“物联网技术与工程”自设博士点下招收微纳器件与电路系统方向的博士研究生，形成了本、硕、博贯穿的人才培养体系。</span></p><p><span>为推进研究生多元招生，加强拔尖创新人才选拔、提高研究生生源质量，根据《江南大学2026年接收推荐免试研究生管理办法》，特制定本实施细则。</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>01</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>接收专业、拟接收名额</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/XUHLWcesK0C7yjHlAZsicqPEW6AicAd1Pmy5LSwKGjYTPacKHRNrGDRbvlTsFNR3bFQ7yK5Thy6dG7rA16iaSYh6A/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>说明：拟接收名额为初步计划，接收名额以最终实际接收人数为准。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>02</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>（一）拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为祖国建设服务，品德良好，遵纪守法，身心健康；</span></p><p><span>（二）2026年普通高等学校应届本科毕业生，本科期间学习成绩优秀，且在现就读学校取得推免生资格；</span></p><p><span>（三）学术研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力倾向；</span></p><p><span>（四）身体健康状况按《普通高等学校招生体检工作指导意见》执行。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>03</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请及接收流程</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>（一）考生登录“江南大学推荐免试硕士研究生预报名系统”（http://yzgmis.jiangnan.edu.cn/zsgl/tmsgl/）</span><span><span>进行报名并提交证明材料，系统截止时间2025年9月22日。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>（二）学院对考生材料进行审核，分批组织考生进行复试，采用校内考生线下复试、校外考生线上复试的形式，复试时间等信息将另行通知，复试合格后发放相应通知。工程硕博士培养改革专项推免生将由联培企业和招生学院组建专业领域面试组另行复试。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>（三）国家推免系统（https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm）</span><span><span>开通后，通过学院考核拟接收的推免生，须及时登录国家推免系统，按照拟接收的专业填报相关志愿，否则视为自动放弃。学院在国家推免系统中发放复试通知和待录取通知，拟接收推免生应在规定时间内接受并确认，否则视为自动放弃。推免生在国家推免系统只能确认一个招生单位的</span></span><span><span>待录取通知，一旦确认不得更改。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>（四）未进行预报名的同学仍可登录国家推免系统进行报名，学院根据实际情况择优选拔。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>04</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>其它说明</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>申请者不按要求报名、网报信息错填或填报虚假信息而造成不能参加考核或录取的，后果由考生本人承担，接收的推免生在入学前未取得本科毕业证、学士学位证或受到处分，均将被取消录取资格。</span></p><p><span>未尽事宜参照《江南大学2026年接收推荐免试研究生管理办法》执行。学院研究生招生工作小组对本学院考生考核结果负责，并负责对考生提出的质疑进行核实并解释。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>05</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>招生咨询</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>联系人</span></p><p><span><span>集成电路学院A315办公室金老师</span></span></p><p><span>咨询电话</span></p><p><span><span>0510-85197369</span></span></p><p><span>咨询邮箱</span></p><p><span><span>jinyusuo@jiangnan.edu.cn</span></span></p><p><span>联系地址</span></p><p><span><span>江苏省无锡市江阴市府前路299号</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><p><span>江南大学集成电路学院</span></p><p><span>2025年9月12日</span></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><span><br/></span></section><hr/><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>往期推荐</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><strong><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkxNDcyODY4NA==&amp;mid=2247494103&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=853f388cd47b5449bf03fc48e69b8d25&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/XUHLWcesK0C7yjHlAZsicqPEW6AicAd1PmgZkNOhepKcV4Au7M1JuHDEvZibUazNjw8E30JpjFCItjgnhta8Vho3g/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></a></strong></section></section><section><span><span>军训快报 I 看！集电迷彩方阵里的最美写真</span></span></section><section><section><strong><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkxNDcyODY4NA==&amp;mid=2247494035&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=a121bcf410447fe9a48d58f48474c018&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=